          "text": "At 211 Wealth’s UR Home, our goal is to help capable individuals navigate difficulty, because we recognize that people are more than their circumstance.",
          "html": "At 211 Wealth’s UR Home, our goal is to help capable individuals navigate difficulty, because we recognize that people are more than their circumstance."
